# F7 test: an arc that names a homeable extra axis must move that axis.
#
# Home only XYZ, so the endpoint-equipped B axis stays un-homed.  The arc
# below carries a B word, which means the extra axis takes part in the move
# and must therefore be rejected until it is homed.  If G2/G3 silently
# dropped extra-axis words, this arc would succeed and the test would fail.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG gcode_arcs_abc.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

# Home XYZ only (bare G28 would also home B).
G28 X Y Z
G1 X20 Y20 Z20 F3000

# B is un-homed, so this arc must fail with "Must home axis B first".
G2 X125 Y32 Z20 B10 I10.5 J10.5 F3000
